### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "qwe",
    "password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de inserção de alocado
POST http://localhost:40000/insertAlocado HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "alocadoid": 0,
    "animalidifk": 3,
    "piqueteidfk": 3,
    "datainicio": "2026-11-01",
    "datafinal": null,
    "removido": false
}

### teste de buscar todas as alocações
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllAlocados HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar alocação por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getAlocadoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

